<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="50"><td teditid="c1r1" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0" id="c1r1" style="background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218); font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-left: 10px solid rgb(190, 199, 106);"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 10px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">Dear Mr/Ms,</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 25px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">Welcome to Monster College™ - a perfect platform for potential employers to connect with fresh graduates and college students across India. Monster College™ is backed by the brand Monster (<a href="http://www.monsterindia.com/" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;"><strong>www.monsterindia.com</strong></a>), a leading job portal with a database of 20,000 employers and 61.3 million cumulative resumes.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign="top" height="300"><td teditid="c1r2" aeditid="c1r2" locked="1" id="c1r2" style="background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218); font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-left: 10px solid rgb(190, 199, 106);"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 25px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);"><strong style="color: rgb(244, 144, 32);">Your account has been created and we are highly pleased to have you as a privileged member of the Monster College™.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;A copy of the Service Agreement executed is attached herewith for your ready reference and record.&nbsp; We request you to go through the Agreement to verify products/services subscribed and payment terms.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 15px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">With this association, we are confident to help you find the right talent for your hiring needs and showcase your employer brand effectively to the potential job seekers.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 15px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">We look forward to having a mutually beneficial relationship.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 15px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">If you have any queries, please feel free to reach out at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:operations@monstercollege.in" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;"><strong>operations@monstercollege.in</strong></a></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 25px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);">Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>Monster College Team<br>Phone: 01204024310 ( Available Monday to Friday from 10:30 Hrs. to 17:00 Hrs.)<br>Email:<strong>&nbsp;<a href="mailto:operations@monstercollege.in" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;">operations@monstercollege.in</a></strong></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px 10px 25px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);"><strong style="color: rgb(244, 144, 32);">Escalation of any Customer Service matter</strong><br>In the unlikely event of your query or complaint not being resolved promptly to your satisfaction, please write a mail to&nbsp;<strong><a href="mailto:operations@monstercollege.in" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;">operations@monstercollege.in</a></strong>&nbsp;as a first level of escalation and to&nbsp;<strong><a href="mailto:crhead@monstercollege.in" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;">crhead@monstercollege.in</a></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;for second level escalation.&nbsp; The matter will be directly investigated by the senior management of our Customer Service team.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 10px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 218);"><strong style="color: rgb(244, 144, 32);">Terms of Use</strong><br>We thank you for using Monster. For uninterrupted access to our services, it is important for you to read and understand our&nbsp;<a href="http://www.monstercollege.in/terms_of_use.html" title="http://www.monsterindia.com/terms_of_use.html" style="color: rgb(103, 54, 148); text-decoration-line: none;"><strong>Terms of Use&nbsp;</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>